Cell["\<\
Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s get the actual value by doing a montecarlo so we can \
get the errors:
First for the Glueballs:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9905989148484554`*^9, 3.9905989309287567`*^9}, {
  3.9905998379738903`*^9, 
